    "text": "centraloregondaily.com\nwebsite\nCentral Oregon, Oregon\nFurever Friends: Apollo\n1 hours ago\nApollo is a 2-year-old poodle, one of 46 poodles rescued from a neglect case. This sweet boy is now looking for a loving forever home and will soon be available for adoption at the Humane Society of Central Oregon.\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nGreg Wilson, CFA\n·\nuser · 19.6K followers\n8 Foods You Can Eat A Lot Of Without Gaining Weight, According to a Dietitian\nKim Yawitz, RD, is a registered dietitian and gym owner in St. Louis, Mo. In addition to coaching fitness and nutrition clients one-on-one and in small groups, Kim also shares her expertise with national media outlets. She enjoys cooking, reading, and spending time with her family.\nSt. Louis, MO ·21d\nDianna Carney\n·\nuser · 35.7K followers\nJim O’Rear\n·\nuser · 19.1K followers\nSatirical AND TRUE: Florida Man Kills & Eats His Pet Peacocks To Prove A Point.\nAh yes, Florida has done it again. Just when you think we’ve run out of bizarre, sun-soaked headlines, we get this gem: “Florida man kills and eats his pet peacocks.” Because when you think of majestic, exotic birds strutting through your yard, naturally your first thought is: skillet or grill?\nHudson, FL ·7d",
